# Second lock: deny everything, then admit exactly what the Dockerfile
# COPYs. The first lock is that COPY names each file individually.
# Neither list is maintained by memory — test_workflow_gates derives
# handler.py's first-party import closure and fails if a module is
# missing from either. storygen.py was missing from both on 2026-08-27.
*
!requirements.txt
!contract.py
!preprocess.py
!storage.py
!handler.py
# The spatial-upscaler revision pin (data, not code) — the media stage's
# bake reads it. Empty by default; an absent file would make the bake
# skip for the wrong reason, so it ships either way.
!ltx-upscaler.pin
!cudaenv.py
!modelroot.py
!modelhydrate.py
# How a cache-resident checkpoint reaches a worker with no HuggingFace
# token: modelhydrate imports it, so denying it here fails the build.
!weights_r2.py
!preview.py
!videogen.py
!ltxcaps.py
!modelprobe.py
!storygen.py
!audio.py
